---
layout: base.njk
title: Notes
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<h1>Notes</h1>

<p>Technical writing — the things worth writing down so the next person
(usually future me) doesn't have to rediscover them.</p>

{% set notes = collections.notes | reverse %}
{% if notes.length %}
<ul class="note-list">
{% for n in notes %}
  <li><a href="{{ n.url }}">{{ n.data.title }}</a>
    <span class="note-date">{{ n.date | dateHeading }}</span></li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p><em>Nothing here yet.</em></p>
{% endif %}
